      "detail": "The enabled plugin page exposes both bundle and component switches. Reload validation selects the bundle switch by accessible name."
    },
    {
      "kind": "product-issue",
      "detail": "Visual inspection found a long account name clipping the mobile sign-out button. The CSS fix passed 12 synthetic width/language/theme combinations. Final installed-package verification is pending."
    },
    {
      "kind": "product-issue",
      "candidate": "be2a8d0a01f2448897f70c475725a6691cb2839d",
      "detail": "A full SIGTERM shutdown reached DSH CLI's fixed five-second deadline. The adapter-stop child completed after the management host exited, while the second runtime-stop command was never launched. The orphan runtime was explicitly stopped using its installed launcher. The correction uses one cleanup child, per-component lifecycle locking, concurrent cleanup dispatch for multiple Bots, and closed-state checks for pending connections.",
      "modelCalls": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "test-readiness",
      "detail": "The first management-host readiness helper expected an unauthenticated HTTP 200. DSH correctly returned HTTP 401. The helper was corrected to recognize the live authenticated service and refresh its private browser session after restart."
    }
  ],
